<title>BRAZIL: Sao Paulo stock exchange closed due to holiday.</title>
<headline>Sao Paulo stock exchange closed due to holiday.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sao Paulo stock exchange remains closed Wednesday due to a public holiday in the whole of Sao Paulo state, but money markets and the foreign currency exchange continue to operate as normal.</p>
<p>((--Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 507 4151))</p>
